{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1688","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1688/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1688/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1688/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1688","id":3589095199,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7V7T8f","number":1688,"title":"Trae的UI吐槽","user":{"login":"Jaylenwa","id":65205528,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjA1NTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65205528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa","html_url":"https://github.com/Jaylenwa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaylenwa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-11-05T03:48:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T06:35:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"为长期的Trae用户，我强忍着让自己适应基于vscode\"优化\"后的UI界面，我原本以为我会被调教适应，但是我发现并没有。\n身边的朋友抛弃Trae的主要原因就是因为魔改后的交互界面，我不知道在商业角度这种修改交互真的能给你们带来好处吗？一个产品不需要通过修改交互界面来证明自己的\"自研\"能力，本质上改变不了什么。\nCursor作为一个优秀的对手，人家依然提供了配置供使用者还原到vscode的原始外观，这让很多原始vscode使用者的上手成本几乎为0，而且AI编辑器诞生之前，我相信多数人对vscode这个交互界面已经深入骨髓了。\n或者你们可以在论坛开个投票，你的投票标题为：你抛弃trae的主要原因是什么：1.产品外观 2.产品能力。我相信不少人会选择1。\n大家用习惯了vscode的交互界面，没必要强行改变它，毕竟你们并没有能力去重新教育用户适应一个新的交互界面，只会让人觉得难以适应。\n作为一个AI辅助编程工具，Trae的核心竞争力我觉得就是Cursor在价格上的下位替代，毕竟你们的价格优势还是很明显的，但是你们却选择了在交互界面上和vscode对抗，这让我觉得很迷惑。\n说这么多就是希望能够**提供一个还原到vscode原始交互界面的选项**，毕竟用户的选择权也很重要的。我相信对你们来说也是有好处。","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1688/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1688/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}